    {
      "type": "tutorial",
      "heading": "Frequently Asked Questions",
      "id": "faq",
      "intro": "Pertanyaan umum seputar Alert Acquirer, klasifikasi, lock management, dan action request.",
      "steps": [
        {
          "num": 1,
          "title": "Apa bedanya Alert Acquirer vs Alert Issuer?",
          "desc": "{previewHtml:1}\n• **Alert Acquirer** — Alert dari sisi merchant/acquirer\n  - Monitoring transaksi merchant\n  - Fokus pada fraud dari sisi penerima pembayaran\n  - Data: merchant info, terminal, acquiring bank\n• **Alert Issuer** — Alert dari sisi cardholder/issuer\n  - Monitoring transaksi pemegang kartu\n  - Fokus pada fraud dari sisi penerbit kartu\n  - Data: cardholder info, card details, issuing bank",
          "color": "#3b82f6",
          "bg": "#eff6ff",
          "previewHtml": {
            "1": "<div style=\"font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,sans-serif;border-radius:14px;box-shadow:0 1px 2px rgba(0,0,0,.04),0 1px 6px rgba(0,0,0,.06);background:#fff;border:1px solid #bfdbfe;overflow:hidden;\"><div style=\"padding:12px 14px;\"><div style=\"display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:8px;\"><div style=\"padding:10px 12px;border-radius:8px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#fff7ed,#ffedd5);border:1px solid #fed7aa;\"><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;margin-bottom:6px;\"><div style=\"width:20px;height:20px;border-radius:6px;background:#f59e0b;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;\"><svg width=\"10\" height=\"10\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"><path d=\"M3 9l9-7 9 7v11a2 2 0 01-2 2H5a2 2 0 01-2-2z\"/></svg></div><span style=\"font-size:10px;font-weight:700;color:#0f172a;\">Acquirer</span></div><div style=\"font-size:8px;color:#64748b;line-height:1.4;\">Merchant side monitoring. Focus on receiving payment fraud.</div></div><div style=\"padding:10px 12px;border-radius:8px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#eef2ff,#e0e7ff);border:1px solid #c7d2fe;\"><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;margin-bottom:6px;\"><div style=\"width:20px;height:20px;border-radius:6px;background:#6366f1;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;\"><svg width=\"10\" height=\"10\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"><path d=\"M3 10h18M7 15h1m4 0h1m-7 4h12a3 3 0 003-3V8a3 3 0 00-3-3H6a3 3 0 00-3 3v8a3 3 0 003 3z\"/></svg></div><span style=\"font-size:10px;font-weight:700;color:#0f172a;\">Issuer</span></div><div style=\"font-size:8px;color:#64748b;line-height:1.4;\">Cardholder side monitoring. Focus on card issuing fraud.</div></div></div></div></div>"
          }
        },
        {
          "num": 2,
          "title": "Bagaimana menentukan klasifikasi alert?",
          "desc": "{previewHtml:1}\n• **NEGATIVE (Not Fraud)** — Transaksi valid, bukan fraud\n  - Customer confirm transaksi\n  - Pattern normal\n  - False positive dari rule\n• **SUSPICIOUS** — Mencurigakan, butuh investigasi\n  - Pattern tidak biasa tapi belum jelas\n  - Menunggu konfirmasi customer\n  - Need more evidence\n• **POSITIVE (Fraud)** — Confirmed fraud\n  - Customer deny transaksi\n  - Clear fraud indicators\n  - Evidence kuat fraud",
          "color": "#f59e0b",
          "bg": "#fffbeb",
          "previewHtml": {
            "1": "<div style=\"font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,sans-serif;border-radius:14px;box-shadow:0 1px 2px rgba(0,0,0,.04),0 1px 6px rgba(0,0,0,.06);background:#fff;border:1px solid #fde68a;overflow:hidden;\"><div style=\"padding:12px 14px;display:grid;gap:6px;\"><div style=\"padding:8px 10px;border-radius:6px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#f0fdf4,#dcfce7);border-left:3px solid #16a34a;\"><div style=\"font-size:9px;font-weight:700;color:#16a34a;text-transform:uppercase;margin-bottom:2px;\">NEGATIVE</div><div style=\"font-size:8px;color:#64748b;\">✓ Customer confirm • Normal pattern • False positive</div></div><div style=\"padding:8px 10px;border-radius:6px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#fffbeb,#fef3c7);border-left:3px solid #f59e0b;\"><div style=\"font-size:9px;font-weight:700;color:#f59e0b;text-transform:uppercase;margin-bottom:2px;\">SUSPICIOUS</div><div style=\"font-size:8px;color:#64748b;\">⚠️ Unusual pattern • Need verification • More evidence</div></div><div style=\"padding:8px 10px;border-radius:6px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#fef2f2,#fee2e2);border-left:3px solid #dc2626;\"><div style=\"font-size:9px;font-weight:700;color:#dc2626;text-transform:uppercase;margin-bottom:2px;\">POSITIVE</div><div style=\"font-size:8px;color:#64748b;\">🚨 Customer deny • Clear indicators • Strong evidence</div></div></div></div>"
          }
        },
        {
          "num": 3,
          "title": "Apakah alert bisa di-lock oleh multiple users?",
          "desc": "{previewHtml:1}\n• **Tidak**, hanya 1 user yang bisa lock alert pada satu waktu\n• Tujuan: Prevent conflict handling antar analyst\n• User lain akan melihat alert ter-lock dengan indicator:\n  - 🔒 Icon locked\n  - Nama user yang lock\n  - Timestamp lock\n• User lain tidak bisa edit atau lock alert yang sama\n• Hanya user yang lock atau admin yang bisa unlock\n• Auto-unlock setelah X jam jika tidak ada activity (configurable)",
          "color": "#6366f1",
          "bg": "#eef2ff",
          "previewHtml": {
            "1": "<div style=\"font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,sans-serif;border-radius:14px;box-shadow:0 1px 2px rgba(0,0,0,.04),0 1px 6px rgba(0,0,0,.06);background:#fff;border:1px solid #c7d2fe;overflow:hidden;\"><div style=\"padding:12px 14px;\"><div style=\"padding:10px 12px;border-radius:8px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#fff7ed,#ffedd5);border:1.5px solid #fdba74;margin-bottom:8px;\"><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;margin-bottom:4px;\"><span style=\"font-size:10px;font-weight:700;color:#0f172a;\">ALT-2024-001234</span><span style=\"padding:2px 8px;border-radius:4px;background:#fff7ed;border:1px solid #fed7aa;font-size:8px;font-weight:700;color:#ea580c;\">🔒 Locked</span></div><div style=\"font-size:8px;color:#64748b;\">Locked by: <span style=\"font-weight:600;color:#0f172a;\">John Analyst</span> • 15 mins ago</div></div><div style=\"padding:8px 10px;border-radius:6px;background:#fef2f2;border:1px solid #fecaca;text-align:center;\"><div style=\"font-size:9px;color:#dc2626;font-weight:600;\">⚠️ Cannot lock - Alert already locked by another user</div></div></div></div>"
          }
        },
        {
          "num": 4,
          "title": "Berapa lama waktu response Action Request?",
          "desc": "{previewHtml:1}\n• **Priority HIGH** — Target 1-2 jam\n  - Critical action (block account, stop transaction)\n  - High risk fraud\n  - Large transaction amount\n• **Priority MEDIUM** — Target 4-8 jam\n  - Standard escalation\n  - Moderate risk\n• **Priority LOW** — Target 1-2 hari\n  - Info request\n  - Low risk\n  - Non-urgent action\n• SLA dapat dikonfigurasi per organization\n• Notification otomatis jika melebihi SLA",
          "color": "#8b5cf6",
          "bg": "#f5f3ff",
          "previewHtml": {
            "1": "<div style=\"font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,sans-serif;border-radius:14px;box-shadow:0 1px 2px rgba(0,0,0,.04),0 1px 6px rgba(0,0,0,.06);background:#fff;border:1px solid #ddd6fe;overflow:hidden;\"><div style=\"padding:12px 14px;display:grid;gap:6px;\"><div style=\"padding:8px 10px;border-radius:8px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#fef2f2,#fee2e2);border-left:3px solid #dc2626;\"><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;\"><span style=\"font-size:9px;font-weight:700;color:#dc2626;text-transform:uppercase;\">HIGH Priority</span><span style=\"font-size:8px;font-weight:700;color:#dc2626;\">⏱️ 1-2 hrs</span></div></div><div style=\"padding:8px 10px;border-radius:8px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#fffbeb,#fef3c7);border-left:3px solid #f59e0b;\"><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;\"><span style=\"font-size:9px;font-weight:700;color:#f59e0b;text-transform:uppercase;\">MEDIUM Priority</span><span style=\"font-size:8px;font-weight:700;color:#f59e0b;\">⏱️ 4-8 hrs</span></div></div><div style=\"padding:8px 10px;border-radius:8px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#eff6ff,#dbeafe);border-left:3px solid #3b82f6;\"><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;\"><span style=\"font-size:9px;font-weight:700;color:#3b82f6;text-transform:uppercase;\">LOW Priority</span><span style=\"font-size:8px;font-weight:700;color:#3b82f6;\">⏱️ 1-2 days</span></div></div></div></div>"
          }
        },
        {
          "num": 5,
          "title": "Bagaimana cara export data alert?",
          "desc": "{previewHtml:1}\n• Klik tombol **Export** di toolbar (ikon download)\n• Pilih format export:\n  - **CSV** — For Excel/spreadsheet analysis\n  - **JSON** — For API integration\n  - **PDF** — For reporting\n• Pilih scope:\n  - Current page\n  - All pages (with current filter)\n  - Selected rows only\n• Data akan include:\n  - Alert info (ID, classification, risk score)\n  - Transaction details\n  - Triggered rules\n  - Lock status & owner\n• File akan di-download otomatis",
          "color": "#14b8a6",
          "bg": "#f0fdfa",
          "previewHtml": {
            "1": "<div style=\"font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,sans-serif;border-radius:14px;box-shadow:0 1px 2px rgba(0,0,0,.04),0 1px 6px rgba(0,0,0,.06);background:#fff;border:1px solid #99f6e4;overflow:hidden;\"><div style=\"padding:12px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #f0fdfa;\"><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;\"><div style=\"width:24px;height:24px;border-radius:6px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#14b8a6,#0d9488);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;\"><svg width=\"12\" height=\"12\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"><path d=\"M4 16v1a3 3 0 003 3h10a3 3 0 003-3v-1m-4-4l-4 4m0 0l-4-4m4 4V4\"/></svg></div><span style=\"font-size:12px;font-weight:700;color:#0f172a;\">Export Data</span></div></div><div style=\"padding:12px 14px;\"><div style=\"margin-bottom:8px;\"><div style=\"font-size:8px;color:#64748b;text-transform:uppercase;margin-bottom:4px;\">Format</div><div style=\"display:flex;gap:4px;\"><span style=\"padding:4px 10px;border-radius:5px;background:#f0fdf4;border:1px solid #86efac;font-size:9px;font-weight:700;color:#16a34a;\">CSV</span><span style=\"padding:4px 10px;border-radius:5px;background:#f8fafc;border:1px solid #e2e8f0;font-size:9px;font-weight:600;color:#64748b;\">JSON</span><span style=\"padding:4px 10px;border-radius:5px;background:#f8fafc;border:1px solid #e2e8f0;font-size:9px;font-weight:600;color:#64748b;\">PDF</span></div></div><div style=\"margin-bottom:8px;\"><div style=\"font-size:8px;color:#64748b;text-transform:uppercase;margin-bottom:4px;\">Scope</div><div style=\"display:flex;gap:4px;flex-wrap:wrap;\"><span style=\"padding:4px 10px;border-radius:5px;background:#f8fafc;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;font-size:9px;font-weight:600;color:#64748b;\">Current Page</span><span style=\"padding:4px 10px;border-radius:5px;background:#f0fdfa;border:1px solid #5eead4;font-size:9px;font-weight:700;color:#14b8a6;\">All Pages</span><span style=\"padding:4px 10px;border-radius:5px;background:#f8fafc;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;font-size:9px;font-weight:600;color:#64748b;\">Selected</span></div></div><button style=\"padding:8px 16px;border-radius:7px;background:#14b8a6;border:none;font-size:10px;font-weight:700;color:#fff;cursor:pointer;width:100%;\">⬇️ Download Export</button></div></div>"
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
